      "writtenOn": "2025-02-11T17:09:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I _think_ the `guest_ack_{share,donation}` functions reject MMIO, so we should be ok.\n\nIn any case, the `range_is_memory()` check here will fail for MMIO, so I think this `if` condition is false regardless of `check_count` when handling MMIO.\n\nDo you agree?",
