      "writtenOn": "2025-02-11T17:38:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But with this change we no longer have this behaviour :\n`Host \u003e (share) Guest` we try \u0026 share a memory page which is counted -\u003e it should ret -EINVAL",
